      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<!-- Magyx — Social proof (kvinnor) — Custom Liquid paste block.\n     8 reviews from Trustpilot (se.trustpilot.com/review/magyx.co), fetched 19.08.2026.\n     Themes: quality, longevity, similarity to the original, skepticism turned around.\n     Ren HTML+CSS, scoped till .ts-proof-sv. Inga Liquid-taggar. -->\n\n<style>\n  .ts-proof-sv{\n    --green:#14843d;\n    --green-dark:#0f6b31;\n    --green-soft:#eaf6ee;\n    --ink:#111315;\n    --muted:#626b74;\n    --line:#e6e8e8;\n    --star:#ffb000;\n    font-family:Inter,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;\n    color:var(--ink);\n    background:linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#f7f8f6);\n    padding:76px 0 53px;\n    overflow:hidden;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}\n  .ts-proof-sv .container{width:min(1180px,calc(100% - 36px));margin-inline:auto}\n  .ts-proof-sv .proof-head{text-align:center;max-width:760px;margin:0 auto 15px}\n  .ts-proof-sv .kicker{\n    font-size:13px;\n    letter-spacing:.13em;\n    text-transform:uppercase;\n    font-weight:800;\n    color:var(--green);\n    margin-bottom:14px;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .section-title{\n    font-size:clamp(26px,3.3vw,43px);\n    line-height:1.02;\n    letter-spacing:-.045em;\n    margin-bottom:12px;\n    font-weight:700;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .carousel{\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:flex-start;\n    gap:22px;\n    overflow-x:auto;\n    scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;\n    scrollbar-width:none;\n    padding:8px 4px 22px;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .carousel::-webkit-scrollbar{display:none}\n  .ts-proof-sv .review-card{\n    flex:0 0 calc(33.333% - 15px);\n    min-width:330px;\n    scroll-snap-align:start;\n    background:#fff;\n    border:1px solid var(--line);\n    border-radius:20px;\n    padding:26px 26px 13px;\n    box-shadow:0 10px 28px rgba(16,34,22,.06);\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .review-top{\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:space-between;\n    gap:14px;\n    margin-bottom:11px;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .review-stars{color:var(--star);letter-spacing:2px;font-size:19px}\n  .ts-proof-sv .verified{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none}\n  .ts-proof-sv .verified:hover{text-decoration:underline}\n  .ts-proof-sv .tp-dot{color:var(--green)}\n  .ts-proof-sv .review-card h3{\n    font-size:16px;\n    line-height:1.22;\n    letter-spacing:-.035em;\n    margin-bottom:14px;\n    font-weight:700;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .review-card p{\n    color:var(--muted);\n    line-height:1.62;\n    font-size:15px;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .review-card p.result-line{\n    margin:8px 0 12px;\n    padding:15px 16px;\n    border-radius:14px;\n    background:var(--green-soft);\n    color:var(--green-dark);\n    font-weight:800;\n    font-size:14px;\n  }\n  .ts-proof-sv .person{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}\n  .ts-proof-sv .person strong{display:block;font-size:14px}\n  .ts-proof-sv .person span{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.35;display:block}\n  @media (max-width:1024px){\n    .ts-proof-sv .review-card{flex-basis:48%}\n  }\n  @media (max-width:700px){\n    .ts-proof-sv{padding:30px 0 21px}\n    .ts-proof-sv .review-card{min-width:86%;flex-basis:86%}\n  }\n</style>\n\n<section class=\"ts-proof-sv\">\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"proof-head\">\n      <div class=\"kicker\">Why they fell for Magyx</div>\n      <h2 class=\"section-title\">They say it better than we ever could.</h2>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"carousel\">\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/magyx.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot review</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8220;I didn't have high expectations that this would actually be legit.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>I had a small tester of JPG La Belle at home to compare with and was surprised how similar they smelled. I also ordered the Lost Cherry dupe, YSL Black Opium dupe, CH Very Good Girl dupe and Acqua Di Gio dupe for my boyfriend, who was also pleasantly surprised. Totally worth it, and I'll order from there again.</p>\n        <p class=\"result-line\">Compared side by side with the original.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Anne Rittwage</strong><span>Verified reviewer on Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/magyx.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot review</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8220;Was a bit skeptical when I ordered.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>But after a really fast delivery I could see the perfumes were incredibly similar to the originals. Very happy!</p>\n        <p class=\"result-line\">Doubtful before. Convinced after.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Annelie</strong><span>Verified reviewer on Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/magyx.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot review</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8220;The perfumes are high quality, smell amazing and stay on the skin for a long time.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>I'm really impressed with Magyx! The order was easy to place, delivery went smoothly and the products were well packaged. An affordable option for anyone who wants luxurious scents without paying too much. I'll definitely shop here again and can warmly recommend Magyx!</p>\n        <p class=\"result-line\">Luxury feel without the luxury price.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Maria</strong><span>Verified reviewer on Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/magyx.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot review</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8220;I could smell the scent on myself all the time.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Usually when I wear perfume the scent fades pretty quickly. Other people told me &#8211; ooh you smell so good, what are you wearing? It's really high quality and luxurious. And I get to feel comfortable and feminine.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Maria</strong><span>Verified reviewer on Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/magyx.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot review</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8220;The perfumes are incredibly beautiful and smell exactly like the originals.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>I bought 3 bottles and got two testers for free.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Huda</strong><span>Verified reviewer on Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/magyx.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot review</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8220;The perfumes smell really good and are like the real ones.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>A great website to shop on. Lasts a long time on the body.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Ellen Gustafsson</strong><span>Verified reviewer on Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/magyx.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot review</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8220;Scents that last long and really smell like the original.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Always fast deliveries.</p>\n        <p class=\"result-line\">Lasts. And smells right.</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Ingela</strong><span>Verified reviewer on Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n      <article class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"review-top\">\n          <div class=\"review-stars\">&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;&#9733;</div>\n          <a class=\"verified\" href=\"https://se.trustpilot.com/review/magyx.co\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"tp-dot\">&#9679;</span> Trustpilot review</a>\n        </div>\n        <h3>&#8220;They all smell magically good.&#8221;</h3>\n        <p>Ordered four different scents and got them plus a fifth as a gift. Delivery was super fast! So happy!</p>\n        <div class=\"person\">\n          <div><strong>Nathalie</strong><span>Verified reviewer on Trustpilot</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </article>\n\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
